    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relive childhood nostalgia, and fear, of past-bedtime gaming in this first-person horror stealth game, where hiding from mother is crucial.</h2><br>In this nightmare, mother watches over as she patrols in the dark of night. To escape, avoid being seen awake and complete your handheld games while mother isn\u2019t watching.<br> <br><strong>For survival, always remember:</strong><br><br>1. Keep an eye out for mother.<br>If she\u2019s about to catch you playing, pretend to be asleep to avoid detection.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090570/extras/01accef35d82f21a54bc5d2f8699169c.avif?t=1754619096\" width=560 height=210 /></span><br><br>2.  Don\u2019t focus entirely on the game. <br>Stay aware of your surroundings. Mother might be watching, and she could even appear right over your shoulder at any moment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090570/extras/81eca2b6f6d4da4e4375c05925a30032.avif?t=1754619096\" width=560 height=210 /></span><br><br>3. Don\u2019t pretend to sleep for too long.<br>If you pretend to be asleep for too long, anxiety will set in and blur your vision of mother.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090570/extras/a4d1d26e240c93fc51d8531a7185707f.avif?t=1754619096\" width=560 height=210 /></span><br><br>4. Be careful with the game at hand.<br>When you lose all lives in your handheld game, mother will sense your frustration and come for you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090570/extras/20a51ded2f2558688f188379daa84f49.avif?t=1754619096\" width=560 height=210 /></span><br><br><br><strong></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcG